This product is designed for deployment with OpenSSL 3.x in environments
where the OpenSSL FIPS provider is configured and enabled by the operator.

Cygnet Provider is NOT a validated cryptographic module. It has not been
submitted to, and holds no certificate from, the NIST Cryptographic Module
Validation Program (CMVP). Cygnet Provider performs no independently
validated cryptography; where FIPS-approved algorithms are required, they
are supplied by the operator-configured validated provider.
